  "question": {
    "text": "Which of the following equations of a line intercepts on the circle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;a chord of longest length?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "F59fu",
      "text": "<math><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lv5g0",
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "f1V89",
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "4jCS0",
      "text": "<math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The chord nearest to the centre of the circle will be the longest chord.<br />From options, we see that the given lines are at a distance of <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>23</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;respectively from the centre <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3,4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is correct</p>",
    "image": null
  },
